WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:05.040
Kamui is as agile as lightning.

00:05.040 --> 00:07.630
He can get here from the capital
in just under two seconds.

00:07.630 --> 00:12.290
However, there are distance limits on
the bloodline's telepathic communication.

00:12.290 --> 00:16.830
I can only send messages to the capital
using several medial dragons as relays.

00:16.830 --> 00:19.580
My only contact method is similar
to playing telephone.

00:19.580 --> 00:23.000
It will take at least forty seconds.

00:23.500 --> 00:26.630
They've caught me ill-prepared.

00:26.630 --> 00:28.750
Well, to be entirely honest,

00:28.750 --> 00:31.540
I didn't want to summon him
in the first place!

00:31.540 --> 00:33.290
Not due to any personal feelings,

00:33.290 --> 00:36.880
but because the enemy prepared
and readied themselves for this battle.

00:36.880 --> 00:42.330
I'd prefer to make elaborate preparations
and preemptively strike them!

00:42.330 --> 00:45.790
What do that trash and
the Reaper want anyway?

00:45.790 --> 00:48.790
Why are they helping the Argentum Corps?

00:48.790 --> 00:53.040
Besides luring Kamui into a trap,
the only thing I can think of is

00:53.040 --> 00:55.290
helping the Silverware Princess escape.

00:55.290 --> 01:00.040
The God of the Winged Bloodline
commanded that Lese be destroyed.

01:00.040 --> 01:02.500
Do they intend to interfere with God's will?

01:02.750 --> 01:04.670
This is mere speculation.

01:04.670 --> 01:06.460
But it does make sense.

01:06.460 --> 01:09.040
There is one more possibility,
although it's an idiotic one.

01:09.040 --> 01:13.500
Maybe for some reason that trash
couldn't use their Spatial Magic

01:13.500 --> 01:18.420
and joined the princess's operation
to escape the country.

01:19.130 --> 01:23.040
But not being able to use Spatial Magic
could just be a pretense

01:23.040 --> 01:25.000
to goad me into summoning Kamui,

01:25.000 --> 01:27.750
and they could take advantage of
that slipup to go to capital.

01:27.750 --> 01:30.580
That can't be ruled out.

01:32.040 --> 01:33.880
There's no doubt

01:33.880 --> 01:38.290
that trash is abandoning the civilians
and trying to rush the teleportation.

01:38.290 --> 01:42.000
That means this is a race to see
whether that scum teleports

01:42.000 --> 01:44.670
or I kill the princess first!

01:44.670 --> 01:46.290
Then it's settled!

01:46.290 --> 01:50.000
Killing the princess is our top priority.

01:50.000 --> 01:53.420
The trump card is in my hand.

01:53.420 --> 01:55.880
What about you?

01:55.880 --> 01:58.880
Reveal the cards in your hand to me!

01:59.710 --> 02:02.960
I really screwed that up.

02:02.960 --> 02:05.290
I can't do shit now.

02:05.670 --> 02:09.290
I hope that moron manages to
safely teleport at least.

02:09.290 --> 02:12.210
Ideally with talented corps members.

02:12.210 --> 02:14.830
And if the princess dies, even better.

02:14.830 --> 02:15.880
Hold up.

02:15.880 --> 02:18.290
With Ragna around, can I control her?

02:18.290 --> 02:20.750
Anyway, this freakin' hurts.

02:20.750 --> 02:23.420
I couldn't even score more than
a half-assed death.

02:23.420 --> 02:26.750
Just pass out alrea-

02:54.540 --> 02:56.420
Ikiru imi sae

02:56.420 --> 02:58.580
Ubaisatteitta

02:58.580 --> 03:00.790
Ibitsuna sekai o

03:00.790 --> 03:03.580
Zenbu kowasou to shiteita

03:03.580 --> 03:05.670
(Subete o hikikae ni)

03:05.670 --> 03:07.880
Chikara o motometa

03:07.880 --> 03:10.000
(Daishou no hate ni)

03:10.000 --> 03:13.000
Nani ga matteita toshitemo

03:13.420 --> 03:17.460
Mirai o kaeru tame ni

03:17.460 --> 03:20.500
Jibun o tokihanatte

03:20.500 --> 03:22.630
Kotae wa dare ni mo

03:22.630 --> 03:24.750
Wakari nado shinai

03:24.750 --> 03:26.580
Dakara jibun de

03:26.580 --> 03:28.880
Kirihiraite yukunda

03:29.170 --> 03:31.210
Aragai nagara

03:31.210 --> 03:33.460
Sagashite ita mono wa

03:33.460 --> 03:37.210
Kibou demo kiseki demo naku tada

03:37.210 --> 03:39.210
Boku wa ima

03:39.210 --> 03:44.790
Kimi to ikiru imi ga hoshii dake

03:58.380 --> 04:03.130
<b>Episode 16: Will of Resistance</b>

04:01.710 --> 04:03.130
Frontline, switch!

04:07.380 --> 04:09.130
Advance!

04:10.380 --> 04:12.540
You'd be better off giving up.

04:12.540 --> 04:14.420
The wind agrees too.

04:21.250 --> 04:22.500
Shit!

04:22.500 --> 04:23.710
My arms are so heavy!

04:23.710 --> 04:25.040
Every step...

04:25.040 --> 04:26.540
is so far away.

04:27.080 --> 04:29.540
Everyone, out of the way!

04:39.210 --> 04:40.920
Advance, now!

04:41.750 --> 04:43.630
Let's go and listen up!

04:43.630 --> 04:45.750
That was my best throw to date!

04:45.750 --> 04:49.130
How did I set a personal record
while I'm running on empty?

04:49.710 --> 04:53.580
That's 'cause I got stronger
during this battle!

04:53.580 --> 04:56.250
Each step we take exhausts us!

04:57.170 --> 05:02.460
But each step we take and
each dragon we hunt,

05:02.460 --> 05:04.420
we get that much stronger!

05:04.420 --> 05:07.290
And that strength means we can
take another step forward

05:07.290 --> 05:09.040
and hunt another dragon!

05:11.330 --> 05:15.420
That means we can keep moving
and get anywhere!

05:18.880 --> 05:21.040
That's some meathead logic!

05:21.040 --> 05:23.380
He's taking "no pain, no gain" too far!

05:23.380 --> 05:24.290
But!

05:24.290 --> 05:25.790
He's onto something!

05:25.790 --> 05:29.750
All we've got left is willpower!
And that's what'll keep us moving forward!

05:50.790 --> 05:53.500
The twins are alive and kicking!

05:53.920 --> 05:57.880
My mighty soldiers,
keep going just a little longer!

05:59.210 --> 06:02.130
Just a little more and
we'll be in firing range!

06:02.830 --> 06:06.670
You want to know if I can locate Olto Zora?

06:07.170 --> 06:08.880
I don't recommend that.

06:09.380 --> 06:13.630
You shouldn't underestimate superior dragons
just because you beat some once...

06:14.000 --> 06:15.290
All right, all right.

06:15.290 --> 06:21.380
Well, directly confronting him
could serve as a trigger...

06:22.250 --> 06:26.130
All I can do is identify the area
that he is highly likely to be located in.

06:26.130 --> 06:28.040
If you can work with that...

06:28.500 --> 06:31.630
He's within one kilometer of the base
on the border side.

06:32.460 --> 06:34.830
The continual explosions to the south

06:34.830 --> 06:37.630
are likely from Ragna and
the Explosive Dragon's battle.

06:38.540 --> 06:50.580
<b>Border side</b>

06:38.540 --> 06:52.540
<b>Base</b>

06:38.540 --> 06:52.540
<b>Silverine Barrier</b>

06:39.250 --> 06:42.080
Taratectra identified Ragna as a threat

06:42.080 --> 06:47.080
and changed the battle's location to put
some distance between them and Olto Zora.

06:48.380 --> 06:52.540
I can assume that Olto Zora's location
will be in this direction.

06:52.880 --> 06:55.170
Outside of Chemical Synthesis,

06:55.170 --> 06:59.960
he also possesses the ability to grow
sight organelles through his blood.

06:59.960 --> 07:04.750
How far he can see depends on
how many he grows.

07:04.750 --> 07:08.460
Under these circumstances, I estimate that
he can see about two kilometers away.

07:08.710 --> 07:11.130
He should be located at a spot

07:11.130 --> 07:14.420
that gives him the widest visual of
the base from the northern border side.

07:14.920 --> 07:17.580
With that intel, I narrowed down the area

07:17.580 --> 07:20.080
and heightened my senses' precision until...

07:21.710 --> 07:22.960
There!

07:22.960 --> 07:26.380
There's an especially black spot
within this world of darkness...

07:26.380 --> 07:29.420
I found you, Olto Zora!

07:29.420 --> 07:31.040
Go mad.

07:40.420 --> 07:41.880
Dance...

07:42.380 --> 07:44.580
Until you bleed yourselves dry.

07:45.540 --> 07:47.960
They still hadn't gone mad yet?

07:47.960 --> 07:51.170
They had, but they were only at
eighty percent madness.

07:51.170 --> 07:54.630
I'll raise it to two hundred percent now.

07:54.630 --> 07:59.080
Once I do, their flesh will disintegrate
within ten minutes,

07:59.080 --> 08:01.750
making it a double-edged sword.

08:02.130 --> 08:05.130
What shall you do, princess?
Is this how you'll lose?

08:05.130 --> 08:06.630
Or...

08:07.250 --> 08:08.460
Prepare for launch!

08:08.460 --> 08:09.670
Aim at our ten o'clock!

08:09.670 --> 08:10.540
Three!

08:10.540 --> 08:11.250
Two!

08:11.250 --> 08:11.830
One!

08:11.830 --> 08:13.040
Go!

08:15.040 --> 08:17.250
Target: Olto Zora!

08:17.500 --> 08:19.000
He's just out of range!

08:19.000 --> 08:21.210
They'll land a hundred meters short!

08:21.210 --> 08:24.040
Start running when you land!

08:24.250 --> 08:25.630
Strike him!

08:25.630 --> 08:27.830
Let him taste the fatal blow
that bested Dornea!

08:27.830 --> 08:30.920
The Argentum Corps' mightiest attack!

08:37.250 --> 08:40.920
So, you managed to pinpoint my location.

08:41.210 --> 08:44.420
What's wrong, trash?
Are you not going to make a move?

08:44.790 --> 08:46.880
If you're not going to do anything,

08:46.880 --> 08:48.880
then I'll put an end to this.

08:51.750 --> 08:53.420
Poison flame blood.

08:53.420 --> 08:55.710
Diffuse and pursue.

08:55.960 --> 08:58.750
You want to pull off
a big maneuver, don't you?

08:58.750 --> 09:00.040
It's so obvious.

09:00.040 --> 09:02.750
That's a pity,
because I already know your game.

09:03.330 --> 09:05.170
No matter how hard you try,

09:05.170 --> 09:08.920
your troops are nothing more than
bait to force the trash's hand.

09:08.920 --> 09:12.290
Isn't that right, Silverware Princess?

09:16.830 --> 09:19.210
I want to be king.

09:19.830 --> 09:22.880
Lakucia, my liege...

09:27.290 --> 09:28.790
At last.

09:31.330 --> 09:33.330
You let your guard down.

09:33.960 --> 09:35.540
Wha-? Who?

09:35.540 --> 09:37.040
An assassin.

09:39.330 --> 09:41.170
Very impressive.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.330
I failed?

09:42.580 --> 09:46.080
You made it this far without being
noticed by my surveillance network.

09:46.290 --> 09:48.040
Who gives a crap!

09:48.040 --> 09:49.790
What's that shining over there?

09:49.790 --> 09:52.210
That doesn't matter in the slightest!

09:52.210 --> 09:53.290
Whose side are you on?

09:53.290 --> 09:53.790
I know I crushed both his brain
and heart at the same time.
Whose side are you on?<b></b>

09:53.790 --> 09:56.330
I know I crushed both his brain
and heart at the same time.
The corps? Or are you that trash's pawn?<b></b>

09:56.330 --> 09:58.170
Is that a fake body?
Of course it matters!<b></b>

09:58.170 --> 10:00.380
I remember that shining!

10:00.380 --> 10:01.250
I...

10:01.250 --> 10:03.670
I've been looking for that shining!

10:03.670 --> 10:05.380
It's the same as her shine!

10:05.380 --> 10:06.040
He's losing it?
It's the same as her shine!<b></b>

10:06.040 --> 10:07.630
He's losing it?
My master is Tia!<b></b>

10:07.630 --> 10:08.250
My master is Tia!

10:08.250 --> 10:09.880
Is it because of his injuries?

10:09.880 --> 10:11.000
That's not it.

10:11.000 --> 10:15.710
He started going off the deep end
the instant he saw Her Highness.

10:16.210 --> 10:17.710
At any rate...

10:17.710 --> 10:20.170
My job here is done.

10:20.460 --> 10:24.330
I leave the rest to you, Your Highness.

10:29.580 --> 10:31.710
Good job, Nazarena!

10:31.960 --> 10:34.710
I almost exercised my
ultimate technique at the wrong spot

10:34.710 --> 10:37.210
and nearly made a fool of myself!

10:37.210 --> 10:39.290
The body on the ground is fake.

10:42.380 --> 10:44.830
The real one is right below us,

10:44.830 --> 10:47.040
one hundred meters underground!

10:53.790 --> 10:55.290
Wh-what?

10:57.000 --> 10:59.960
The earth around me is soaring upwards!

10:59.960 --> 11:03.420
I-is she trying to drag me up to the surface?

11:12.380 --> 11:13.500
Chris!

11:13.500 --> 11:15.380
I'm leaving the throw to you!

11:15.630 --> 11:16.960
You can count on me!

11:18.170 --> 11:20.000
They caught up to us!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.630
It's do or die time!

11:22.630 --> 11:24.500
Put your lives on the line
for our commander!

11:24.500 --> 11:25.330
Yeah!

11:32.040 --> 11:34.670
My memories aren't in color.

11:34.670 --> 11:39.330
I cannot recall any of my
emotions from that day.

11:39.330 --> 11:41.790
Or I thought I couldn't...

11:42.330 --> 11:44.500
What's with that look?

11:44.500 --> 11:49.000
That's quite a vacuous expression
for the smartest of my young servants.

11:49.000 --> 11:51.170
Oh, I'm aware.

11:51.170 --> 11:53.290
I shall not be king.

11:53.830 --> 11:57.420
That's why I'm telling you to assist me.

11:57.750 --> 12:01.750
You understand what it means that I've
divulged my ambitions to you?

12:01.750 --> 12:06.790
It means I have no intention of parting
with a single one of you.

12:07.580 --> 12:12.540
Why am I remembering her so clearly now?

12:13.080 --> 12:14.880
It's obvious.

12:14.880 --> 12:17.920
It's because I saw the Silverware Princess.

12:17.920 --> 12:21.580
I've now beheld how she
scintillates with light...

12:21.580 --> 12:22.920
And danger.

12:22.920 --> 12:25.540
I must eliminate the princess right away.

12:26.710 --> 12:28.170
But...

12:29.540 --> 12:32.460
If seeing that shine more closely

12:32.460 --> 12:35.540
would bring just a bit of color
to my memories...

12:35.790 --> 12:39.670
Then being dragged up like this...

12:39.670 --> 12:42.710
Comrade. The forest is amiss.

12:42.710 --> 12:43.540
What?

12:43.540 --> 12:45.920
The magic level is quickly rising.

12:45.920 --> 12:48.130
Don't allow the dragons to enter the forest.

12:48.130 --> 12:49.500
Something is-

13:02.380 --> 13:03.830
The forest acted on its own!

13:03.830 --> 13:05.920
Stop! Stop now!

13:15.250 --> 13:17.040
I can't control it?

13:17.040 --> 13:18.880
Is this one of that scum's schemes?

13:18.880 --> 13:19.710
No...

13:19.710 --> 13:22.290
It's also attacking the corps!

13:23.330 --> 13:24.880
It's an aftershock.

13:24.880 --> 13:26.080
Impossible!

13:26.630 --> 13:29.420
The true ruler of the Writhing Shade,

13:29.420 --> 13:32.040
Borgius, the Verdant Sea Dragon,

13:32.040 --> 13:35.040
has regained the power from his prime?

13:40.330 --> 13:42.000
That crazy old man!

13:42.000 --> 13:45.130
You have no business meddling with
our lovely little war!

13:45.420 --> 13:48.830
Actually, this may be a good thing.

13:48.830 --> 13:53.580
There was something wrong with me earlier
when I was being dragged up...

13:53.580 --> 13:55.880
What was I going to do?

13:55.880 --> 13:57.790
Not yet, comrade.

13:57.790 --> 13:59.670
We're not done!

14:02.460 --> 14:05.580
Sta-! Hin-! Me! Pro-!

14:02.460 --> 14:05.580
<b>Stay behind me! I'll protect you!</b>

14:05.580 --> 14:07.960
Sir Rea-! Shoul-! Preserve!

14:05.580 --> 14:07.960
<b>Sir Reaper, shouldn't you preserve</b>

14:07.960 --> 14:10.540
Preserve! Stren-! Explo-!

14:07.960 --> 14:10.540
<b>your strength for the Explosive Dragon?</b>

14:10.540 --> 14:12.210
You!

14:10.540 --> 14:12.210
<b>You're the ones who need to stay behind me!</b>

14:12.210 --> 14:15.380
Cut!

14:12.210 --> 14:15.380
<b>I've got nothing to cut!</b>

14:17.000 --> 14:21.250
I'm the one who will become the strongest!

14:21.460 --> 14:23.460
You ready, Tara darling?

14:23.460 --> 14:26.080
Yes, ready.

14:33.330 --> 14:34.960
Gotta get aw-!

14:38.080 --> 14:40.710
Twofold Arm: Mountain-Leveling Cannon!

14:41.210 --> 14:42.210
One.

14:42.750 --> 14:43.670
Two.

14:44.920 --> 14:45.750
Three.

14:46.630 --> 14:47.790
Four!

14:47.790 --> 14:48.790
Five!

14:49.540 --> 14:51.790
Six-Part Explosion!

14:53.290 --> 14:55.080
A direct hit.

14:55.080 --> 14:57.670
That should've def killed them.

14:58.250 --> 15:01.580
It's difficult to confirm with
the smoke and flames.

15:01.580 --> 15:05.330
We must not be negligent when it
comes to an enemy like the Reaper.

15:05.670 --> 15:09.130
The forest seems to have calmed down a bit.

15:09.130 --> 15:10.750
How are things over there?

15:10.750 --> 15:11.830
Wait.

15:25.670 --> 15:28.670
Have you found the
Silverware Princess's body?

15:30.540 --> 15:31.630
Nope.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.790
Stop this.

15:32.790 --> 15:35.830
But I can't imagine she survived that.

15:35.830 --> 15:39.880
Perhaps she was flung so far,
she got buried under earth.

15:40.290 --> 15:42.540
What am I saying?

15:42.540 --> 15:44.250
Then should I fire?

15:44.250 --> 15:47.540
I can spread the bullets over a wide area.

15:47.540 --> 15:51.880
No, just watch out for the man
who might be the Reaper.

15:51.880 --> 15:54.920
Fortunately, most of the horde
has left the forest.

15:54.920 --> 15:56.420
Stop it.

15:56.420 --> 15:59.670
We'll find her body quickly
with their numbers.

15:59.670 --> 16:01.500
Stop lying to your comrade.

16:01.500 --> 16:03.540
I'm losing it.

16:11.830 --> 16:15.290
Thinking back on it, I knew
something was wrong from the start.

16:15.290 --> 16:17.830
I was delighted by her brilliance,

16:17.830 --> 16:20.380
disappointed by her inexperience,

16:20.380 --> 16:23.420
and titillated by going to war
for the first time in ages.

16:23.420 --> 16:24.540
No.

16:24.540 --> 16:27.710
Even after I realized that trash was
here working in the shadows,

16:27.710 --> 16:30.210
I fixated on her.

16:31.210 --> 16:35.380
Was that actually a cool-headed decision?

16:44.130 --> 16:49.920
Before, I lived a life bathed in shining
brilliance and was not as I am now.

16:50.420 --> 16:52.040
With my subordinates,

16:52.040 --> 16:53.420
my comrade,

16:53.420 --> 16:57.500
and the one I desired to give
my everything, my liege.

16:58.580 --> 17:02.500
Everything was awash with light
during my time.

17:02.500 --> 17:04.790
During our time.

17:10.040 --> 17:12.500
Our era of glory came to an end.

17:12.500 --> 17:15.500
And I was revamped into
my fresh and fab self.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.130
But...

17:23.670 --> 17:27.670
Everything I lost that day is here,
right before my very eyes!

17:27.670 --> 17:31.500
It's a pleasure to meet you,
Silverware Princess, Starlia Lese.

17:32.960 --> 17:35.920
That was a splendid battle.

17:35.920 --> 17:38.960
I pay my most sincere respect
to the valiant efforts

17:38.960 --> 17:42.130
of you and your troops.

17:45.830 --> 17:48.000
Do you know of Princess Lakucia?

17:48.420 --> 17:50.670
She was a heroic woman who
charmed many warriors

17:50.670 --> 17:52.540
with her innate unusual
abilities and charisma,

17:52.540 --> 17:56.210
and accomplished many military feats
thanks to her leadership.

17:56.580 --> 17:59.710
Eventually, the Solarians
deemed her a miracle of God,

17:59.710 --> 18:02.210
and she became a Dragon Scourge.

18:02.380 --> 18:04.960
Even children know all about her.

18:04.960 --> 18:08.710
I've always thought she was
a knockoff of me!

18:08.710 --> 18:13.790
Still, the world believes you're the
second coming of Princess Lakucia.

18:13.790 --> 18:16.420
Olto Zora is a total femboy.

18:17.210 --> 18:20.130
But when he was human,
he wasn't like that at all.

18:20.920 --> 18:23.580
Not even under the
blood oath of the bloodline

18:23.580 --> 18:28.250
was he able to serve the enemy
as his original self.

18:29.540 --> 18:31.250
Princess Starlia,

18:31.250 --> 18:35.580
no matter what happens,
please don't give up fighting.

18:36.250 --> 18:39.830
The unrelenting forms of you
and your troops will be

18:39.830 --> 18:44.040
a slow-acting poison for Olto Zora
and drive him mad.

18:44.670 --> 18:48.080
Your life shouldn't end here.

18:48.830 --> 18:53.540
Join the full-fledged members
of our bloodline, Starlia Lese.

18:54.920 --> 18:57.960
Victory is imminent!

18:58.380 --> 19:02.130
Your shining splendor
should not leave this world.

19:02.130 --> 19:05.580
I will ask the Winged Monarch for you.

19:05.580 --> 19:10.000
If you become a member of the bloodline
and shed your humanity,

19:10.000 --> 19:12.830
that shouldn't violate God's will.

19:15.630 --> 19:18.880
Your subordinates wish this as well.

19:18.880 --> 19:21.000
I can sense that.

19:21.000 --> 19:23.750
Actually, I know they do.

19:25.420 --> 19:27.250
Do you...

19:27.830 --> 19:29.000
What?

19:29.000 --> 19:34.460
Do you know why I shine so brightly?

19:36.170 --> 19:41.710
This world created silverine to be
the will of resistance.

19:41.710 --> 19:47.420
Thus, my control of it means
my splendor is the will of the world.

19:47.420 --> 19:50.040
Did your injuries scramble your brain?

19:50.040 --> 19:51.880
I'm not following you.

19:52.250 --> 19:56.040
I was no match for you as a general.

19:56.040 --> 19:59.080
You'd best me as a warrior
as well, I daresay.

19:59.080 --> 20:01.040
But that's fine!

20:02.210 --> 20:04.830
If there is a sole domain
I outclass you in...

20:05.290 --> 20:09.500
In this area overrun by magic,
I have a heightened will of resistance!

20:09.500 --> 20:12.380
And I can give that will an apt form!

20:12.380 --> 20:18.000
My talent as neither a general nor a warrior
makes me feel the most pride!

20:19.170 --> 20:22.000
Being a forger of silver weapons does!

20:22.630 --> 20:24.460
Princess-Style Forging Arts!

20:25.290 --> 20:27.210
Embodied Restraints!

20:33.540 --> 20:35.920
You done with that now?

20:35.920 --> 20:40.000
Apparently, you're really not thinking straight
because of your utter exhaustion.

20:40.330 --> 20:45.250
I won't call your will into question anymore
and get to administering my poison-

20:46.460 --> 20:47.960
Heave-ho!

20:47.960 --> 20:50.630
You think we'd want our commander to
keep living even if she became a dragon?

20:50.630 --> 20:52.040
No way in hell!

20:52.040 --> 20:56.880
I'd rather she die an honorable death
than sink to the likes of you monsters!

20:57.290 --> 20:59.130
Yep, that's right.

20:59.750 --> 21:02.960
I dunno what it is you see in her.

21:03.330 --> 21:05.080
But we still...

21:06.080 --> 21:08.000
haven't lost!

21:09.630 --> 21:10.880
Let's go!

21:10.880 --> 21:12.080
Commander!

21:13.000 --> 21:14.630
Thought Unison!

21:17.960 --> 21:20.960
Everyone, you've done an incredible job!

21:20.960 --> 21:22.920
You've held on until this chance at victory!

21:22.920 --> 21:26.040
Those who can no longer fight,
and those on the verge of death

21:26.040 --> 21:30.540
keep moving forward and muster the will
to slay dragons and leave it all to me!

21:31.830 --> 21:33.920
Your Highness!

21:39.830 --> 21:41.790
I'll concentrate it and send it flying!

21:50.460 --> 21:52.750
Shatter him!

21:52.750 --> 21:54.210
Target!

21:54.210 --> 21:56.670
Taratectra!

21:56.670 --> 21:59.290
Look out, Tara dear!

21:59.290 --> 22:02.080
And scatter his pieces!

22:25.960 --> 22:33.000
Honshou wa kakushiteiru tsubasa no uchi ni,
mudana agaki to shitte mo

22:33.000 --> 22:39.710
Kodoku kara naru itami sae taete izure
tayorinai mirai, kibou

22:39.710 --> 22:43.500
Raisan o kumo ni suru kuuchuusen,
yokkyuu oshikorosu koujou ja

22:43.500 --> 22:46.790
Ibitsuna katachi shika umi enai

22:46.790 --> 22:53.750
Akegata, higashi kara noboru hikari o
watashi no mono ni nante wagamama

22:53.750 --> 22:57.880
Aimaina kotoba ja todokanai hodo

22:57.880 --> 23:06.210
Kurakute mabushii tokoro made
shinjitai to dou ieba ii

23:06.880 --> 23:11.380
Hada de kanjita ima iki o tsuiteiru koto sae

23:11.380 --> 23:15.500
Houridaseru youna netsu ga mi o yaite mo

23:15.500 --> 23:22.080
Ano machi e kaeru tame
no hane ga mou sukoshi oshii

23:22.080 --> 23:29.580
Ah, kono mama doko made mo iketara
soko wa atatakai basho de

23:29.580 --> 23:34.290
Fureru ni wa mada yawarakai mama da
